  `ricciVar_lcomb`, `scalarVar_lcomb` are reused.
* Complexification (`CTan`, `cplx`): a complex tangent is a pair of real tangents `τ_R + i τ_I`; a real-linear
  variation `V` extends by `V_ℂ(τ) = V(τ_R) + i V(τ_I)`, which is proved additive and **complex**-homogeneous
